                <pb facs="0148" n="78" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg78"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Rescript from the Palace.</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Matters shall be settled when the daimios who have been summoned assemble at
                    Kioto. In case any matter should arise before their arrival at Kioto, you will
                    consult with the two or three clans acquainted with the foreign (disposition or
                    foreign matters,) and arrange a postponement.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
